        {
          "path": "_m/g/f/n/t/provost-skene-s-house-wp/skene-115877-colin-smith.jpg",
          "filename": "Skene-115877-Colin Smith.jpg",
          "caption": "Provost Skene's House. This rubblestone building is one of the oldest left in Aberdeen. It was formerly houses in the old town, then became a lodging house. Today it houses one of the city's museums with period displays in each room. There is also a fine cafe on the ground floor which sells fine cakes and rowies!",
          "alt": "Provost Skene's House. This rubblestone building is one of the oldest left in Aberdeen. It was formerly houses in the old town, then became a lodging house. Today it houses one of the city's museums with period displays in each room. There is also a fine cafe on the ground floor which sells fine cakes and rowies!",
