          "filename": "Doorway of Provost Skene's House - geograph.org.uk - 560176.jpg",
          "caption": "Doorway of Provost Skene's House. Doorway of this 16th Century town house. See 560164 for more information on the house. Just inside on the left is an excellent café, busy mid-morning with pensioners enjoying a concessionary rate. The helpful receptionist came out and offered to take a photo of the two of us when he saw me photographing; very welcome as we don't get many photos with both of us.",
